        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 added support for  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/customElementRegistry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Element.customElementRegistry</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/customElementRegistry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Document.customElementRegistry</code></a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ShadowRoot/customElementRegistry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ShadowRoot.customElementRegistry</code></a> behind the preference <code class=\"notranslate\">dom.scoped-custom-element-registries.enabled</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the experimental features page update and corresponding link from FF150 release note page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127730538\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43555\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43555/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43555\">#43555</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43592",
            "title": "FF150 ExprFeat: customElementRegistry on Document, Element, ShadowRoot",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-27T04:50:04.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-27T04:48:26.000Z",
            "author": {
