        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141215061?u=a9271c92151c7a29629057e254a5699c551496b5&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated the descriptions so that the next vertical line is always positioned according to the writing mode, independent of script direction.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">both <code class=\"notranslate\">vertical-rl</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">vertical-lr</code> share:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LTR → top-to-bottom<br>\nRTL → bottom-to-top</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">vertical-rl</code> : lines stack to the left.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">vertical-lr</code> : lines stack to the right.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43546.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127032329\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43546\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43546/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43546\">#43546</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43585",
            "title": "Correcting vertical-rl and vertical-lr descriptions.",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-26T12:36:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-26T12:34:29.000Z",
