        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16916029?u=ce07a7a0c1d36afec6bb06694d76b546fa4eb1cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>update two DOM overview bullets to reference <code class=\"notranslate\">Element.querySelector()</code> where the examples call <code class=\"notranslate\">document.body.querySelector(...)</code></li>\n<li>keep the code samples unchanged because the implementation already matches <code class=\"notranslate\">Element</code> semantics</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>npm install --force</li>\n<li>npm run lint:md --force</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43582",
            "title": "Fix querySelector method references in DOM examples",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-26T16:45:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-26T10:10:46.000Z",
