        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56009637?u=2c59626cda2ec34a16e55d6071ceaffb1698a34a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Applies the css invert to the item in the example labelled <code class=\"notranslate\">invert() filter</code> instead of the SVG invert for the <code class=\"notranslate\">SVG filter equivalent</code>, and fixes the SVG filter equivalent with a class as the document's text explains rather than as an inline SVG.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The changes keep the content accurate and make the playground more useable.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
