        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">font-width</code> SVG attribute (only supported in Safari 18.4 for now)</li>\n<li>Mention <code class=\"notranslate\">font-width</code> as a modern alias at <code class=\"notranslate\">font-stretch</code> SVG attribute page</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add missing attribute</li>\n<li>Clarify legacy/modern status</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43229.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3980744004\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43229\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43229/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43229\">#43229</a></li>\n</ul>",
