        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227569687?u=4d080a52f318b27812ffeaac93b306fff32403d3&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR fixes a misleading sentence in the dispatchEvent() documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Changes made:</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Converted the return value description into a clear and complete sentence</li>\n<li>Improved readability for beginners</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Result:</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The behavior of dispatchEvent() return value is now easier to understand.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43525.\">Closes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4118052510\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43525\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43525/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43525\">#43525</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Proof of change: ISSUE (false if event is cancelable, and at least one of the event handlers which received event called Event.preventDefault(). Otherwise true.)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">(Screenshot attach here)</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/227569687/568240591-876e9fa9-4192-4361-befd-c7ce6da5ccee.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1OTI3OTAsIm5iZiI6MTc3NDU5MjQ5MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8yMjc1Njk2ODcvNTY4MjQwNTkxLTg3NmU5ZmE5LTQxOTItNDM2MS1iZWZkLWM3Y2U2ZGE1Y2NlZS5wbmc_.AnianwEiQuEKdC4aUGvNfJXsAWI1la6-slBC66iB7pg\"><img width=\"554\" height=\"144\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-03-24 14-31-16\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/227569687/568240591-876e9fa9-4192-4361-befd-c7ce6da5ccee.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1OTI3OTAsIm5iZiI6MTc3NDU5MjQ5MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8yMjc1Njk2ODcvNTY4MjQwNTkxLTg3NmU5ZmE5LTQxOTItNDM2MS1iZWZkLWM3Y2U2ZGE1Y2NlZS5wbmc_.AnianwEiQuEKdC4aUGvNfJXsAWI1la6-slBC66iB7pg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 144px;\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/227569687/568241200-f0c565d0-bccb-48b1-a4c7-5f573a63e908.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1OTI3OTAsIm5iZiI6MTc3NDU5MjQ5MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8yMjc1Njk2ODcvNTY4MjQxMjAwLWYwYzU2NWQwLWJjY2ItNDhiMS1hNGM3LTVmNTczYTYzZTkwOC5wbmc_.JBAo-QDOMGUfqF-mypgWSzzeaXYEcpUM4GexBgehFEM\"><img width=\"1299\" height=\"691\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-03-24 14-32-20\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/227569687/568241200-f0c565d0-bccb-48b1-a4c7-5f573a63e908.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzQ1OTI3OTAsIm5iZiI6MTc3NDU5MjQ5MCwicGF0aCI6Ii8yMjc1Njk2ODcvNTY4MjQxMjAwLWYwYzU2NWQwLWJjY2ItNDhiMS1hNGM3LTVmNTczYTYzZTkwOC5wbmc_.JBAo-QDOMGUfqF-mypgWSzzeaXYEcpUM4GexBgehFEM\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 691px;\"></a>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43545",
            "title": "Fix #43525: Improve clarity of dispatchEvent() return value",
